    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0400_sailor_02",
      "hash": "4d9b65f4be6bb486",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "欢迎乘坐圣特安努号！\\c\\n请等一下，\\n这位乘客，您的船票呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0400_sys_01",
      "hash": "0c44b0c349338b86",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]向船员\\n出示了船票！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0400_sailor_03",
      "hash": "4d9b66f4be6bb639",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好的！可以了！\\n欢迎您乘坐圣特安努号！\\c\\n……啊！\\n这位乘客，祝贺您中奖！\\c\\n我们为今天第100位登船的乘客\\n准备了这个——！\\c\\n请收下这套能带来\\n海洋般清新气氛的服装！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0400_sys_02",
      "hash": "0c44afc3493389d3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从船员那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]水手套装[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0400_sys_04",
      "hash": "0c44b5c349339405",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把[VAR COLOR(0006)]水手套装[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n放入了换装箱里！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0400_sailor_04",
      "hash": "4d9b67f4be6bb7ec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
